Z||000000||pollock||09-07-2000||09:57 AM||||wazzuuuuuuuupppppp  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/tongue.gif"><P>Decided to drive my fiero today with the Ttops out, since it's finally down into the 90s again.......<P>Anyway, i had a particularly hard time keeping it running once started, and then i noticed kind of a funky smell.  Not gas exactly, just stinky, chemicaley smell. Still stunk when i got to work 10 minutes later.<P>Bad converter maybe?<P>I get an EGR trouble code from time to time and haven't done anything about it.  I need to do the old solenoid cleaning routine.  Any other suggestions?||||reg||1
Z||000001||pHoOl||09-07-2000||10:32 AM||||Get one of those little trees that hang from your rear view mirror.  Sorry, i just had to be a smart ass, i have no real solution for you, but hopefully i made you chuckle a little bit.<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.gvsuphool.homestead.com/files/pHoOl_sig.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000002||HugGRRRFiero||09-07-2000||10:44 AM||||I'd check the EGR valve for sure.  A bad EGR valve or one that's leaking because the post on the underside is rusted away will make it tough to keep the engine running, basically, it will die if you let off the gas.  The smell is probably the converter backing up because of it.  (not sure if yours is a 4 or 6, but should be the same for both)<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/huggrrr.gif">  <BR>  <A HREF="mailto:HugGRRRFiero@hotmail.com">HugGRRRFiero@hotmail.com</A> ||||reg||1
Z||000003||Vlad||09-07-2000||11:14 AM||||How do you do that cleaning routine for EGR <BR>solenoid??<P>I also get EGR code from time to time. No leacks, EGR valve is OK with new gasket. But there is almost no vacuum in the line to EGR valve when engine is running.<BR>So I blame the dolenoid.||||reg||1
Z||000004||pollock||09-07-2000||11:31 AM||||good one, Phool.... but if you recall, i was the one who started the thread about the pine tree air freshener group purchase; got plenty of them on hand.<P>As for cleaning the solenoid, i think there's a section on it in Ogre's Cave.<P>I blame the dolenoid, too.<P>||||reg||1
